      "knowledgeIds": ["formula-writing", "chemical-name"],
      "knowledgePoints": ["formula-writing"],
      "explanation": "A正确：Na⁺和OH⁻组成NaOH；B错误：氯化铁中铁为+3价，应为FeCl₃；C正确：CuSO₄；D正确：Fe₂O₃。题目问书写正确，ABCD中B是FeCl₂错误。"
